<title>USA: HitCom launches Internet media service.</title>
<headline>HitCom launches Internet media service.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>HitCom Corp said Thursday it has established an electronic media sales agency called &quot;Spark!&quot; that is specifically geared toward the Internet.</p>
<p>The company said it hopes to attract companies interested in doing business on the Internet through the new division, which will focus on offering marketing and advertising services in cyberspace.</p>
<p>HitCom is a marketing and publishing company.</p>
<p>Its stock was up 1/4 at 1-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
